# Security checks for Layer 2 host access ports (leaf roles, Security tab).
# Reference: knowledge/security/SEC-baseline-junos.md §10
# Syntax: see knowledge/README.md

# @id SEC-L2-STORM @sev 3 @title "Host access port without storm control" @doc "SEC-baseline-junos §10"
# @practice "Apply storm control to every host access port."
# @scope ^set interfaces (?P<ifd>(?:ge|xe|et|mge)-[\d/]+) unit 0 family ethernet-switching interface-mode access
set interfaces {{ifd}} unit 0 family ethernet-switching storm-control {{*}}

# @id SEC-L2-BPDU @sev 3 @title "Host access port does not block BPDUs" @doc "SEC-baseline-junos §10"
# @practice "Block BPDUs on host access ports so a host cannot inject spanning-tree frames."
# @scope ^set interfaces (?P<ifd>(?:ge|xe|et|mge)-[\d/]+) unit 0 family ethernet-switching interface-mode access
set protocols layer2-control bpdu-block interface {{ifd}}
